#: ffpretty/app_help.py:17
msgid ""
"FFmpeg 友好前端。将 FFmpeg 参数直接转发给后台进程，并在前台\n"
"            输出美化过的转码信息和进度。附赠媒体文件的详细信息查询功能。\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"FFmpeg-friendly frontend. Passes FFmpeg arguments directly to the background process, and shows beautified transcoding info and progress in the foreground. Also provides detailed media file inspection."
"            "

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:28
msgid "转码模式"
msgstr "Transcode Mode"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:29
msgid "ffpretty -i <输入文件> [FFmpeg 选项] <输出文件>"
msgstr "ffpretty -i <input file> [FFmpeg options] <output file>"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:33
msgid "强制覆盖"
msgstr "Force Overwrite"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:34
msgid "覆盖已存在的输出文件。注意此选项由 ffpretty 自身处理，不会透传给 FFmpeg。"
msgstr "Overwrite existing output files. Note that this option is handled by ffpretty itself and is not passed through to FFmpeg."

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:38
msgid "安全模式"
msgstr "Safe Mode"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:39
msgid "跳过已存在的输出文件（默认启用）。此选项由 ffpretty 自身处理，不会透传给 FFmpeg。"
msgstr "Skip existing output files (enabled by default). Handled by ffpretty itself, not passed through to FFmpeg."

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:44
msgid "查询模式"
msgstr "Inspect Mode"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:45
msgid "ffpretty <媒体文件1> [<媒体文件2> …]"
msgstr "ffpretty <media file 1> [<media file 2> …]"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:49
msgid "媒体文件"
msgstr "Media Files"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:53
msgid ""
"输入媒体文件的路径，多个文件以空格分隔。查询结果会被缓存到数据库中，重复查询直接读取缓存。\n"
"\n"
"提示：也可以通过 -i 语法传入文件且不指定输出目标来进入查询模式，此时会忽略非文件选项。"
msgstr ""
"Paths to media files, separated by spaces. Results are cached in a database; repeated queries read from the cache."
""
"Tip: you can also enter inspect mode by passing files with -i syntax and no output target; non-file options are ignored."

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:62
msgid "杂项"
msgstr "Misc"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:63
msgid "显示此帮助信息"
msgstr "Show this help message"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:64
msgid "开启调试模式，显示内部诊断信息"
msgstr "Enable debug mode and show internal diagnostic info"

#: ffpretty/app_help.py:65
msgid "模拟运行，不调用 FFmpeg、不写文件"
msgstr "Pretend run; does not invoke FFmpeg or write files"

#: ffpretty/appcontext.py:60
msgid "-y/--overwrite 与 -n/--no-overwrite 不可同时使用。"
msgstr "-y/--overwrite and -n/--no-overwrite cannot be used together."

#: ffpretty/appenv.py:54
msgid "再次按下 Ctrl+C 确认退出"
msgstr "Press Ctrl+C again to confirm exit"

